    "all_text_labels": [
      "KEEP THE QUESTION. REPAIR THE MISMATCH. BUILD WHAT IS MISSING.",
      "The Generative Return Path: Witnessed Difference, Exact Coboundary Repair, and Justified Representation Extension",
      "Generative Engine Lead",
      "PROTECTED QUESTION:",
      "Q(S)",
      "must remain computable under operations.",
      "Presentation preservation: q = q' \u2218 u",
      "Data update: Q(S \u222a \u0394) = Eval(S, \u0394)",
      "Regime B",
      "1. WITNESSED DISTINCTION",
      "x",
      "w : R(x, y)",
      "y",
      "Forbidden: x \u223c y",
      "Primitive Irreflexivity Law:",
      "\u2200 z, \u00acR(z, z)",
      "(No self-relation)",
      "Choose Additive Realization:",
      "D_f(x, y) = f(y) - f(x)",
      "2. TWO KINDS OF MOVEMENT WITHIN REGIME B & THE RETURN PATH",
      "A. EXACT LOCAL REPAIR",
      "v\u2081: \u03b1\u2081=0",
      "v\u2082: \u03b1\u2082=1",
      "v\u2083: \u03b1\u2083=2",
      "e\u2081\u2082=1",
      "e\u2082\u2083=1",
      "e\u2083\u2081=-2",
      "\u03c9 = (1, 1, -2),  \u03b1 = (0, 1, 2)",
      "d\u2080\u03b1 = (1, 1, -2)",
      "\u03c9 - d\u2080\u03b1 = (0, 0, 0)",
      "[\u03c9] = 0 (Exact Coboundary)",
      "Discrepancy vanishes; nodes stay.",
      "B. CERTIFIED REMAINDER",
      "v\u2081",
      "v\u2082",
      "v\u2083",
      "e\u2081\u2082=1",
      "e\u2082\u2083=1",
      "e\u2083\u2081=1",
      "\u03c9 = (1, 1, 1)  \u21d2  L \u03c9 = 3",
      "Repair Law: L d\u2080 = 0",
      "\u03c9 - d\u2080\u03b1 = (0, 0, 3) \u2260 0",
      "[\u03c9] \u2260 0 (Invariant Circulation)",
      "Mismatch moved; charge remains.",
      "C. THE RETURN PATH (B')",
      "Justified Representation Extension",
      "Propose new coordinate / memory:",
      "B \u21a6 B' : add (SUM, COUNT)",
      "Check Preservation: Q_B \u2291 Q_B'",
      "Existing answers stay valid under retraction",
      "Evaluate again under Regime B' \u21ba",
      "No justified extension available:",
      "Retain explicit residual (FAIL-CLOSED)",
      "3. COCHAIN COMPLEX & OPERATIONAL TRANSITION ALGEBRA",
      "C\u2070",
      "Potentials (\u03b1)",
      "d\u2080",
      "C\u00b9",
      "Differences (\u03c9)",
      "d\u2081",
      "C\u00b2",
      "Closure Checks",
      "Endpoint Cancellation Proves d\u2081 \u2218 d\u2080 = 0:",
      "(d\u2081d\u2080f)(x,y,z) = [f(z)-f(y)] - [f(z)-f(x)] + [f(y)-f(x)]",
      "              = f(z) - f(y) - f(z) + f(x) + f(y) - f(x)",
      "              = 0   (Endpoints cancel identically)",
      "Operational Repair Group Laws:",
      "E_\u03b1(\u03c9) = \u03c9 - d\u2080\u03b1   \u21d2   E_\u03b1 E_\u03b2 = E_(\u03b1+\u03b2)",
      "E_0 = id,   [E_\u03b1(\u03c9)] = [\u03c9]",
      "d\u2081 E_\u03b1(\u03c9) = d\u2081 \u03c9  (Preserves closure)",
      "4. GENERATIVE PRINCIPLE IN PRACTICE: INCREMENTAL AVERAGE MAINTENANCE",
      "1. Two Distinct Histories",
      "History A: {1, 5}",
      "Sum = 6,  Count = 2,  Mean = 3",
      "History B: {2, 3, 4}",
      "Sum = 9,  Count = 3,  Mean = 3",
      "Distinction existed at genesis",
      "2. Lossy Cache & Event",
      "Lossy Representation:",
      "p(A) = 3,  p(B) = 3  (COLLAPSED!)",
      "Common Incoming Event:",
      "Insert item 9  into dataset",
      "Report lost the distinction",
      "3. Divergent Required Truth",
      "True A new mean: (6+9)/3 = 5",
      "True B new mean: (9+9)/4 = 9/2 (4.5)",
      "Update Collapse Theorem:",
      "No deterministic update U(mean=3, ins=9)",
      "can produce BOTH 5 and 4.5!",
      "Operation made the loss matter",
